# Points web/Expo Go at the LOCAL backend for testing today's client-booking
# work (4-digit OTP, self-service booking, etc.) — none of that is deployed
# to the online Render backend yet.
#
# Without this override the web build would derive its API from the
# browser's own hostname (localhost:3456 by default), which happens to be
# correct right now — this line just makes it explicit and easy to flip.
#
# To go back to testing against the deployed backend, uncomment this line:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://mobile-backend-kwda.onrender.com/api/v1
